# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts of the Astro/Starlight documentation site (docs/).
# The site sources (docs/package.json, docs/astro.config.mjs, docs/src/ …)
# are tracked; everything regenerable via `npm install` / `npm run build`
# inside docs/ is ignored so forks and clones stay small.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/node_modules/
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/

# Python bytecode / virtualenvs (host-side helper scripts only)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
